; The manual's "Columns that make room": a vector summed, with the checks of vector-ref written out.
function vsum(v: vec)
A:  len = ##vector-length(v)
    goto B(i=0, s=0)
B:  if fx<(i, len) goto C else goto D
D:  return s
C:  if fx>=(i, 0) goto C1 else goto K
C1: if fx<(i, len) goto E else goto K
K:  fail
E:  e = ##vector-ref(v, i)
    i2 = fx+(i, 1)
    s2 = +(s, e)
    goto B(i=i2, s=s2)
